project:HallaHealth
    a :Project ;
    schema:name "Halla Health" ;
    rdfs:seeAlso <https://scopeimpact.fi/halla-health-a-new-decentralized-health-service-and-diverse-data-broker> ;
    :learnedFrom <https://scopeimpact.fi/halla-health-a-new-decentralized-health-service-and-diverse-data-broker> ;
    :inDomain domain:DigitalHealth, domain:ClimateHealth, domain:AIEnabledHealthcare, domain:AccessibleHealthcare ;
    :builtWith skill:AWS, skill:PayloadCMS, skill:WebMCP, skill:OAuth, skill:Flutter, skill:OTAUpdates, skill:GoogleVertexAI, skill:VoiceAI, skill:Promptfoo, skill:ToolCalling, skill:SQLite, skill:OnDeviceRAG ;
    :accelerates :ContentProduction, :HomeBasedCareTasks ;
    :contributesTo
        value:ImproveHumanWellBeing,
        :HumanInTheLoopValidation,
        :OfflineFirstCareAccess,
        :HealthChatbotGuardrails,
        :OnDeviceRetrieval,
        :LifeSavingHealthcareAccess,
        :CommunitySelfCare,
        :HealthDataDiversity,
        :SecureHealthWallet,
        :ClimateHealthRiskManagement,
        :PublicHealthSystemEfficiency ;
    rdfs:comment "AI-driven decentralized self-care and diverse health data brokerage service for communities across Europe, Asia, and Africa. The public mission includes personalised location-specific health information, WHO-recommended home-based care tasks, a secure health wallet for records, climate-related health risk support, access to life-saving care, government resource savings, and bridging the health data diversity gap across health R&D. Used Payload CMS with Web MCP connected through OAuth to accelerate content production while keeping review human-in-the-loop through Payload review workflows. Integrated Google Vertex AI voice AI with Promptfoo evaluations to add guardrails for a health chatbot. Implemented on-device RAG through tool calls that query SQLite content on the device. Included offline-first OTA delivery through a Flutter mobile app." .

